th, or will you end up watching your rule fall apart again and again?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mess up, and it’s game over — no second chances. Push any meter too far, and you’re out. Maybe the people revolt. Maybe you turn into a tyrant. Or maybe everything just falls apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple unique decision cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different — and keeps getting fresher</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New cards unlock the more you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No meter hints, no safe choices — only your gut</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Think you’ve got what it takes to keep the republic together?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let’s see how long <i>your</i> rule lasts.</p>",
